    'Zet hem aan bij <a href="#settings/netscan" data-goto="settings/netscan">Instellingen → Beveiliging → Netwerkscan</a>.' => 'Turn it on under <a href="#settings/netscan" data-goto="settings/netscan">Settings → Security → Network scan</a>.',
