    'Geen gegevens. Staat DPI aan in UniFi (Settings → Traffic Identification)?' => 'No data. Is DPI on in UniFi (Settings → Traffic Identification)?',
    'Volgens UniFi (Traffic Identification), sinds het apparaat verbonden is.' => 'According to UniFi (Traffic Identification), since the device connected.',
